90 - 119 completed rides = 2% cashback of total finished rides final price;
120 - 149 completed rides = 4.5% cashback of total finished rides final price;
150 - 189 completed rides = 6% cashback of total finished rides final price;
190+ completed rides = 9% cashback of total finished rides final price;

