*Topics*:

# {color:#008da6}+*Information on data protection*+{color}{color:#008da6}*:*{color}

* Not found any data protection information in the app, 
* Your company's website does not provide any information about who is responsible for data protection in accordance with the GDPR or how they can be contacted. 
* No email address for data protection concerns
* Which of my personal data has been processed or is currently still being processed;
* For what specific purposes this data has been processed;
* On what legal basis you base the respective processing;
* The sources from which the data originates, if it was not collected from me;
* The specific recipients or categories of recipients who have received or will receive my data, including all processors and all international transfers;
* How long the personal data will be stored and the criteria used to determine the storage period.
* due to the lack of any information on the controller, it is not possible to determine a one-stop-shop procedure or to check which branch is actually responsible as the lead supervisory authority.

➡️ All this information is available on Bolt’s website, specifically in the Privacy Notice and List of Controllers available both in German and in English here: [https://bolt.eu/de-at/privacy/?category=rides|https://bolt.eu/de-at/privacy/?category=rides|smart-link] 

# {color:#008da6}+*Exercise of data subjects' rights:*+{color}

* Exercising my rights as a data subject in your system is made considerably more difficult, as the contact form provided is limited to 255 characters and is therefore unsuitable
* lack of comprehensible information about the purposes of the processing, the legal basis, and the controller and their contact details

➡️ No need to comment on contact form at this stage, IMO.

➡️ The rest of the requested information is available on Bolt’s website, specifically in the Privacy Notice and List of Controllers available both in German and in English here: [https://bolt.eu/de-at/privacy/?category=rides|https://bolt.eu/de-at/privacy/?category=rides|smart-link] 

