# {color:#008da6}+*Data deletion*+{color}{color:#008da6}*:*{color}

* Please also inform me if and when personal data relating to me has been deleted.

➡️ Not aware of any deletion request, we will check with CS and engineers if any such request reached us. 

# {color:#008da6}+*Marketing consent:*+{color}

* Since installing the app, I have received a total of five newsletters at my Apple Relay address ([v27x75s6mg@privaterelay.appleid.com|http://v27x75s6mg@privaterelay.appleid.com/])
* Not asked to consent to receiving marketing messages or being asked to opt in during the registration process. 
* None of the messages contained an option to unsubscribe in accordance with Section 174 (3) of the German Telecommunications Act (TKG). 

